#: ../../tools/mondo_tools.rst:95 4e3f134fbe254412b33a703d8666ae62
msgid "**Name**: ``Mondo_search_disease``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mondo_tools.rst:97 39a4b234f1dd488eb6493b71b63f0de6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the Mondo Disease Ontology for diseases by name "
"or keyword. Mondo unifies disease identifiers across OMIM, Orphanet, "
"DOID, MeSH, ICD-10, NCIT, and other ontologies into a single MONDO ID. "
"Returns matching disease entries with their Mondo IDs, descriptions, and "
"cross-references. Use this to find the Mondo ID for a disease before "
"querying Mondo\\_get\\_disease or Mondo\\_get\\_disease\\_phenotypes. "
"Examples: 'Alzheimer' returns MONDO:0004975, 'breast cancer' returns "
"MONDO:0007254, 'diabetes' returns MONDO:0005015."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mondo_tools.rst:101 47be92c48bde41b0b80810e5c7e8b8bd
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Disease name or keyword to search. "
"Examples: 'Alzheimer', 'breast cancer', 'type 2 diabetes', 'Parkinson', "
"'cystic fibrosis', 'sickle cell'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mondo_tools.rst:104 7917ef7b10624d09b32fb3e8f1a3cc0e
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(default: 10, max: 50)."
msgstr ""

